{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42620","headline":"题宣州延庆寺益公院 · 杨夔","name":"题宣州延庆寺益公院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘿坐能除万种情，腊高兼有赐衣荣。\n讲经旧说倾朝听，登殿曾闻降辇迎。\n幽迳北连千嶂碧，虚窗东望一川平。\n长年门外无尘客，时见元戎驻斾旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}